{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/44ykB1cO3CY3FoeGf_kUjA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:49.166131+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/44ykB1cO3CY3FoeGf_kUjA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>点击蓝字 关注我们</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/DVqRQPfmJzaoZG2MWvFJHRRr5FOs7HsXiagJkHmpky94EmlpEF5XTmY0yliaAoGPRbLSa6aonsS8oCfSLZarYsCA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><b><span><font><span><span>一、学院简介</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><font><span><span>学科实力雄厚，特色鲜明</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>外国语学院拥有完善的本硕博培养体系，设有外国语言文学一级学科硕士点及翻译专业硕士学位点，并开创了国内首个</span></span></font><font><span><span>“</span></span></font><font><span><span>海事语言及应用</span></span></font><font><span><span>”</span></span></font><font><span><span>二级学科博士点。学院学科排名位居全国前列，外国语言文学在第四轮学科评估中获评</span></span></font><font><span><span>B-</span></span></font><font><span><span>级，跻身全国前</span></span></font><font><span><span>50</span></span></font><font><span><span>名。学院注重学科交叉，与学校航运、物流、海洋等优势学科深度融合，为学生提供独特的研究视角和学术资源。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><font><span><span>国际化办学，视野开阔</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>学院英语类各专业与英国朴茨茅斯大学（</span></span></font><span><span>University of Portsmouth</span></span><font><span><span>）有</span></span></font><font><span><span>“3+1”</span></span></font><font><span><span>双本科学位、</span></span></font><font><span><span>PSE</span></span></font><font><span><span>预科语言班合作项目；与英国卡迪夫大学（</span></span></font><font><span><span>Cardiff University</span></span></font><font><span><span>）有</span></span></font><font><span><span>“1+1+1”</span></span></font><font><span><span>双硕士学位合作项目；与澳大利亚科廷大学（</span></span></font><font><span><span>Curtin University</span></span></font><font><span><span>）有</span></span></font><font><span><span>“2+1”</span></span></font><font><span><span>双硕士学位合作项目。学院日语专业与日本长崎外国语大学（</span></span></font><font><span><span>Nagasaki University of Foreign Studies</span></span></font><font><span><span>）有</span></span></font><font><span><span>“2+2”</span></span></font><font><span><span>（双本科学位）、</span></span></font><font><span><span>“3+1”</span></span></font><font><span><span>或</span></span></font><font><span><span>6</span></span></font><font><span><span>个月的留学合作项目；与日本鹿儿岛大学（</span></span></font><font><span><span>Kagoshima University</span></span></font><font><span><span>）有互免学费交换生项目等。另外，学生还可以参加瑞典的世界海事大学（</span></span></font><font><span><span>World Maritime University</span></span></font><font><span><span>）、英国普利茅斯大学（</span></span></font><font><span><span>University of Plymouth</span></span></font><font><span><span>）等的长短期留学合作项目和寒暑期海外学习（实习）项目。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><font><span><span>师资力量强大，科研平台丰富</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>学院现有专任教师</span></span></font><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>5</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>人，其中教授</span></span></font><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>2</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>人，副教授</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>23</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>人，</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>高级职称占比</span></span></font></span><span><span>达</span></span><span><font><span><span>三分之一</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>。近十年，学院教师承担国家级、省部级科研项目</span></span></font><span><span>50</span></span><font><span><span>余项，</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>获得</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>多项重要学术奖项。学院设有多个研究所和考试中心，为学生提供丰富的科研实践机会。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>专业介绍及导师介绍详见</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>外国语学院</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>网站</span></span></font><font><span><span>https://cfl.shmtu.edu.cn/</span></span></font><font><span><span>。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><font><span><span>就业前景广阔，社会认可度高</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>学院毕业生以扎实的专业能力和突出的综合素质深受用人单位青睐，就业岗位包括新加坡港务局、上海海事局、全球捷运物流有限公司、利兹大学、上海海事大学、海事类职业技术学院的航运管理、物流管理、教育、翻译等。</span></span></font></span></p><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/DVqRQPfmJzaoZG2MWvFJHRRr5FOs7HsXtOb2kxP8IFRzTdEtSphFmtNxchN5GwL34lEx86JmRsaKjfWHVFscFw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/DVqRQPfmJzaoZG2MWvFJHRRr5FOs7HsXjbuXR6y6zxtslev1N8QAsZoAUAkgWgicFk1ibqqbcq7G9hGljoHHcicAw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/DVqRQPfmJzaoZG2MWvFJHRRr5FOs7HsXzrU6JoW1NtAOpPaFHVjEPyiaonCPs8xFK9ib3qZnYyd5GtHU262ibtJhw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>国际会议同声传译</span></span></p><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/DVqRQPfmJzaoZG2MWvFJHRRr5FOs7HsX1kIQVUz4Ne40sRW2nibhrxhiaXoc8hZLvce8wGhictgBfaN0Rgw1ribegw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>历年承担重大翻译、译审任务</span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>二、接收专业</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/DVqRQPfmJzaoZG2MWvFJHRRr5FOs7HsXQTfjhWwibL7ZLXPVk2N4sE4LKsdqG4vzStRfMicTVNnNwlZGxia2kwjMw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>三、申请条件与激励措施</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><font><span><span>申请条件</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>1</span></span><font><span><span>）</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>2</span></span><font><span><span>）达到所在高校推荐免试生要求的</span></span></font><font><span><span>202</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>7</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>届本科毕业生。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><font><span><span>激励措施</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>1</span></span><font><span><span>）推免生可优先获得硕博连读资格。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>2</span></span><font><span><span>）可提前修读研究生课程及发表相关科研成果，满足条件可申请提前毕业。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>3</span></span><font><span><span>）优先获得学术发展相关培育项目，优先推荐实习实践单位，优先推荐出国研学，优先资助国内外学术交流，优先提供海事管理、海事教育相关研究生产教融合联合培养、科考活动（含上船）等机会，优先推荐参加各类研究生学科竞赛等。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>4</span></span><font><span><span>）优先考虑</span></span></font><font><span><span>“</span></span></font><font><span><span>助研</span></span></font><font><span><span>”“</span></span></font><font><span><span>助教</span></span></font><font><span><span>”“</span></span></font><font><span><span>助管</span></span></font><font><span><span>”</span></span></font><font><span><span>岗位。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>5</span></span><font><span><span>）可提前进入研究生导师科研团队，依托导师团队在本科阶段取得的科研成果，在取得本校研究生学籍后，可予以认定。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>6</span></span><font><span><span>）其他激励措施具体可咨询钟老师（</span></span></font><font><span><span>021-38282708</span></span></font><font><span><span>）。</span></span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>四、</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>预</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>报名工作安排</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1. </span></span><font><span><span>申请时间：即日起至</span></span></font><font><span><span>2026</span></span></font><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>9</span></span></font><font><span><span>月</span></span></font><font><span><span>20</span></span></font><font><span><span>日</span></span></font><font><span><span>24</span></span></font><font><span><span>时。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>2. </span></span><font><span><span>申请方式</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>与</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>网址：</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10254/user/login/login</span></span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>在上海海事大学推免生预报名系统注册后进行网上报名，请按系统要求如实填写申请信息。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>本年度已注册我校</span></span></font><font><span><span>“优秀大学生夏令营”项目的申请人，可直接使用该项目用户名和密码进行登录，招生项目须选择“推免预报名”。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>特别提醒：请如实填写各项信息，如填报虚假信息，一经核实，将取消录取资格，并通报所在院校。</span></span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>五、</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>正式报名及接收推荐免试研究生工作安排</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span><span>申请人获得所在高校推免资格后，待全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（网址：</span></span></font><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm，以下简称“推免服务系统”）开通后，申请人需及时在该系统中进行填报。学校将及时通过推免服务系统向符合条件的申请人发送复试通知、组织复试、发送待录取通知。</span></span></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span><span>电话：</span></span></font><span><span>021-38284585</span></span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></font><span><span>gs_admission@shmtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>网址：</span></span></font><span><span>https://yz.shmtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>微信公众号：上海海事大学研究生招生</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>外国语学院，期待与你同行！</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"573439f0356167d613ae5b0b2d2a9b55e16b67db58a5eb423586057905521f3d","textLength":1757,"sourceSha256":"5c4000fe07ef22ad062668d980cd6f9e2adbcecfa9868ddbc929353d7fbf0889","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-60d508f0e849d9b650b5","title":"2026年上海海事大学外国语学院关于接收2027年推荐免试研究生报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:49.166131+00:00"}
